; Rooks: the setup's English words, in plain language (design 0011, section 4). Replaces Tauri's English.nsh, so every
; string Tauri's installer reads is here. "{{product_name}}" is filled in by the installer when it shows the message.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Add or reinstall"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Already installed"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} is already installed. Choose what to do, then click Next."
LangString appRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "{{product_name}} is open. Close it, then try again."
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_ENGLISH} "{{product_name}} is open.$\nClick OK to close it."
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose what to do."
LangString chooseHowToInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose how to install ${PRODUCTNAME}."
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Put a shortcut on the desktop"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Keep the installed version"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Keep the installed version (this setup cannot replace a newer one without removing it first)"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "{{product_name}} could not be closed. Close it yourself, then try again."
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing Microsoft Edge WebView2, which Rooks shows its window with..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is already installed. Installing an older one is not recommended. If you want it anyway, remove the newer one first. Choose what to do, then click Next."
LangString older ${LANG_ENGLISH} "older"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An $R4 version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is installed. It is best to remove it first. Choose what to do, then click Next."
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This setup cannot replace a newer version without asking. Run it without /S to choose.$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} could not be removed."
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Remove ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Remove it before installing"
LangString unknown ${LANG_ENGLISH} "unknown"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Rooks needs Microsoft Edge WebView2. Ask your IT team to install it."
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Microsoft Edge WebView2 could not be downloaded ($0)."
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Microsoft Edge WebView2 downloaded."
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloading Microsoft Edge WebView2..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Microsoft Edge WebView2 could not be installed (code $1)."
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Microsoft Edge WebView2 installed."
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also remove my chats, keys and the Room"
